  <!-- Pawn assignment feedback (RitualState.TogglePawnAssignment).
       Forced/CannotAssign/CannotAssignReason: {0} = pawn name, {1} = reason.
       Selected / Deselected: {0} = pawn name. NowAt: {0} = pawn name (spoken
       after the list reorders so the user knows their cursor's current row). -->
  <RimWorldAccess.Rituals.Pawn.IsForced>{0} принудительно назначен на эту роль, изменить нельзя.</RimWorldAccess.Rituals.Pawn.IsForced>
  <RimWorldAccess.Rituals.Pawn.CannotAssignWithReason>Нельзя назначить: {0}. {1}</RimWorldAccess.Rituals.Pawn.CannotAssignWithReason>
  <RimWorldAccess.Rituals.Pawn.CannotAssign>Нельзя назначить: {0}.</RimWorldAccess.Rituals.Pawn.CannotAssign>
  <RimWorldAccess.Rituals.Pawn.SelectedName>{0}: выбрано.</RimWorldAccess.Rituals.Pawn.SelectedName>
  <RimWorldAccess.Rituals.Pawn.DeselectedName>{0}: выбор снят.</RimWorldAccess.Rituals.Pawn.DeselectedName>
  <RimWorldAccess.Rituals.Pawn.NowAt>Текущая позиция: {0}</RimWorldAccess.Rituals.Pawn.NowAt>

  <!-- Quality-stats mode transitions (RitualState.ToggleQualityStatsView).
       ReturnedToRoleList / ReturnedToPawnSelection: spoken on Tab/Escape back.
       FactorsCountOne/Many: {0} = factor count; split for English "1 factor"
       vs "N factors" (used inside the two Instructions keys below). Note: we
       keep Instructions as a whole-sentence key so translators can reorder
       subject/verb/object freely. -->
  <RimWorldAccess.Rituals.QualityStats.ReturnedToRoleList>Возврат к списку ролей.</RimWorldAccess.Rituals.QualityStats.ReturnedToRoleList>
  <RimWorldAccess.Rituals.QualityStats.ReturnedToPawnSelection>Возврат к выбору персонажа для роли: {0}.</RimWorldAccess.Rituals.QualityStats.ReturnedToPawnSelection>
  <RimWorldAccess.Rituals.QualityStats.InstructionsOne>Статистика качества. {0} фактор. Вверх и вниз для навигации, Alt+I для подробностей, Tab для возврата.</RimWorldAccess.Rituals.QualityStats.InstructionsOne>
  <RimWorldAccess.Rituals.QualityStats.InstructionsMany>Статистика качества. {0_numCase ? фактор : фактора : факторов}. Вверх и вниз для навигации, Alt+I для подробностей, Tab для возврата.</RimWorldAccess.Rituals.QualityStats.InstructionsMany>
  <RimWorldAccess.Rituals.QualityStats.HeaderOne>Статистика качества. {0} фактор.</RimWorldAccess.Rituals.QualityStats.HeaderOne>
  <RimWorldAccess.Rituals.QualityStats.HeaderMany>Статистика качества. {0_numCase ? фактор : фактора : факторов}.</RimWorldAccess.Rituals.QualityStats.HeaderMany>

  <!-- Quality breakdown (Alt+I in QualityStats, RitualState.OpenQualityStatBreakdown). -->
  <RimWorldAccess.Rituals.QualityStats.BreakdownWithTooltip>{0}. {1}</RimWorldAccess.Rituals.QualityStats.BreakdownWithTooltip>
  <RimWorldAccess.Rituals.QualityStats.NoBreakdown>Подробное описание для этого фактора недоступно.</RimWorldAccess.Rituals.QualityStats.NoBreakdown>

  <!-- Start ritual (RitualState.StartRitual). -->

  <!-- Blocking issues surfaced during Open (RitualState.GetBlockingIssues).
       DraftedParticipants is spoken when any assigned participant is drafted. -->

  <!-- LordJobDialogState generic messages (covers ritual, psychic-ritual, gravship launch).
       These are intentionally distinct from the Ritual-specific keys above which mention
       "ritual" or "pawns required by the ritual" — the LordJob variants are dialog-agnostic.
       RoleLocked: spoken when user tries to enter pawn selection for a locked role.
       NoDialogOpen: fallback when Alt+S is pressed but no adapter is present.
       CannotStart: {0} = blocking issues joined with ". " -->
  <RimWorldAccess.Rituals.LordJob.RoleLocked>Роль заблокирована. Все назначенные персонажи обязательны.</RimWorldAccess.Rituals.LordJob.RoleLocked>
